{"title": "Llewella", "pageid": 2079, "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Llewella</b> is a Princess of Amber and sister to <a href=\"/wiki/Corwin\" title=\"Corwin\">Corwin</a>. She was born of an affair <a href=\"/wiki/Oberon\" title=\"Oberon\">Oberon</a> had with Moins. She is older than <a href=\"/wiki/Brand\" title=\"Brand\">Brand</a> and younger than <a href=\"/wiki/Bleys\" title=\"Bleys\">Bleys</a>. Llewella removed herself from the presence of her family, and lives in <a href=\"/wiki/Rebma\" title=\"Rebma\">Rebma</a>, an underwater city that is a reflection of <a href=\"/wiki/Amber\" title=\"Amber\">Amber</a>.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<dl><dd><div class=\"notice metadata plainlinks\" id=\"stub\"><i>This article is a <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Article_stubs\" title=\"Category:Article stubs\">stub</a>. You can help Amberpedia Wiki by  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://princeofamber.fandom.com/wiki/Llewella?action=edit\">expanding it</a>.</i></div></dd></dl>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260430112214\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.007 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.011 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 8/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 327/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    1.793      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    1.793      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.1_prod_princeofamber:pcache:idhash:2079-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260430112214 and revision id 4463. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>", "sections": [], "links": [{"ns": 14, "title": "Category:Article stubs", "exists": 